<title>MEXICO: U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Nov 6.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Soybean Association updated Thursday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico.</p>
<p>Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the</p>
<p>marketing year Sept 1 - Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending    Accum Total    Week Ending    Accum Total</p>
<p>    12/10/95	   N/A	    10/10/96	   136,500</p>
<p>    19/10/95	  292,200	 18/10/96	   182,100</p>
<p>    25/10/95	   N/A	    24/10/96	   265,700</p>
<p>    01/11/95	  365,700	 30/10/96	   351,000</p>
<p>    08/11/95	  382,700	 06/11/96	   405,000</p>
<p>    --Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail</p>
<p>at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
</text>
